      "occurrences": 1,
      "site": "event_engine_shims/tcp_client.cc:65, SR.547",
      "analysis": "The endpoint unique_ptr is accessed only on ep.ok(); failed connection results contain status rather than endpoint storage. GCC uninit dump merges the inactive pointer alternative into later move/destruction paths.",
      "control": "20000 success/failure cases use actual EventEngine endpoint shim create/destroy, callback StatusOr and post-move status; live endpoint count returns to zero. Zero Valgrind errors/losses. Full translation unit reproduces the diagnostic; reduced control does not."
    },
    "operation_handler": {
      "occurrences": 1,
      "site": "std::optional::_M_engaged in client_call.cc OpHandlerImpl metadata factory",
