      "site": "chttp2_transport.cc:2547,2555,2559,2561",
      "analysis": "A fixed 31-byte grpc_slice_malloc allocation cannot select the 23-byte inline representation. GCC retains the impossible inline branch when it vectorizes header writes.",
      "control": "10000 exact 31-byte HPACK headers compare byte-for-byte; 70000 allocations cover 0,1,23,24,31,32,4096 bytes and check storage selection/read-write bounds. Zero Valgrind errors/losses. Exact full translation unit reproduces four reports; reduced control does not."
    },
    "server_requested_call": {
      "occurrences": 1,
      "site": "server.cc:1306 local rm",
      "analysis": "Private RequestedCall::Type is const and has two constructors, setting BATCH_CALL or REGISTERED_CALL; the switch assigns rm for both. GCC retains an out-of-domain enum path.",
      "control": "100 real server lifetimes exercise both request constructors, queued requests canceled by shutdown and both APIs after shutdown: 500 completion checks. No invalid accesses or definite/indirect loss; only the already accepted bounded Abseil pool records."
    },
    "server_poll_metadata": {
      "occurrences": 1,
